{"scenes":[{"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"lines":[{"text":"Kaelen, serrant les anneaux entre ses mains, sentait les faibles auras dimensionnelles le guider vers l'est. Le trajet fût intense mais la magie agissait comme un fil d'Arianne.","speaker1_x":482.0,"speaker1_y":600.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1427.0,"speaker2_y":549.0,"speaker2_w":353.0,"speaker2_h":577.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"SlideGauche","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelenAnneaux","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Avec Valérius et le reste de sa troupe, il arrivèrent bientôt devant une forteresse faite en peau et en bois. Des skarls montaient la garde du haut de plusieurs tours de guet tandis que d'autre protéger la porte, armés d'épées et d'haches.","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker1_y":599.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1479.0,"speaker2_y":602.0,"speaker2_w":300.0,"speaker2_h":451.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"SlideDroite","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelenAnneaux","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Valérius : \" Ils sont bien organisé et trop nombreux \" ","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker1_y":600.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1479.0,"speaker2_y":602.0,"speaker2_w":300.0,"speaker2_h":451.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"SlideDroite","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Valérius : \" Mais si Gorrak est à l'intérieur, c'est notre seule chance. Kaelen, vous nous avez beaucoup aider dans cette traque mais pourrais-je vous demander un dernier service?\"","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker1_y":600.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1479.0,"speaker2_y":602.0,"speaker2_w":300.0,"speaker2_h":451.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"SlideDroite","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Valérius : \" Pourriez vous utilisez votre magie afin d'ouvrir des portails et invoquer vous même des Skarls pour les combattres? \"","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker1_y":600.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1479.0,"speaker2_y":602.0,"speaker2_w":300.0,"speaker2_h":451.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Kaelen: ( En souriant ) \" Biensûr Valérius ! Je vais même faire mieux que ça !","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker1_y":600.0,"speaker1_w":319.0,"speaker1_h":456.0,"speaker2_x":1479.0,"speaker2_y":602.0,"speaker2_w":300.0,"speaker2_h":451.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":1419.0,"obj1_y":579.0,"obj1_w":380.0,"obj1_h":500.0,"obj2_x":1219.0,"obj2_y":652.0,"obj2_w":390.0,"obj2_h":513.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelenIncantation","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":true,"wait_after_ms":2000.0},{"text":"Kalen puisa dans ses forces, et plusieur portail s'ouvrit en même temps, partout autour de la forteresse.","speaker1_x":483.0,"speaker